{"text": "The king had a beautiful daughter, whose spirit was as fiery as his own. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He loved her more than anything in the world. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Among the kings servants was a young man of low birth. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was handsome and brave, and the princess loved him deeply. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Her love was warm and strong, and it had a great deal of fire in it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One day the king discovered their secret love. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Without a moments delay, he threw the young man into prison. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A day was set for his trial in the arena. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The fiercest tiger and the most beautiful young lady in the land were chosen for the doors. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Everyone knew that the young man had loved the princess.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "k", "i", "n", "g", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "a", " ", "b", "e", "a", "u", "t", "i", "f", "u", "l", " ", "d", "a", "u", "g", "h", "t", "e", "r", ",", " ", "w", "h", "o", "s", "e", " ", "s", "p", "i", "r", "i", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", "s", " ", "f", "i", "e", "r", "y", " ", "a", "s", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "o", "w", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "l", "o", "v", "e", "d", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "m", "o", "r", "e", " ", "t", "h", "a", "n", " ", "a", "n", "y", "t", "h", "i", "n", "g", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "o", "r", "l", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "m", "o", "n", "g", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "k", "i", "n", "g", "s", " ", "s", "e", "r", "v", "a", "n", "t", "s", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "y", "o", "u", "n", "g", " ", "m", "a", "n", " ", "o", "f", " ", "l", "o", "w", " ", "b", "i", "r", "t", "h", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", 